  "notes": "{伸|の}びる is an ichidan intransitive verb meaning to stretch, extend, or grow.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {伸|の}ばす (transitive, to stretch something)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {髪|かみ}が{伸|の}びる: hair grows\n- {背|せ}が{伸|の}びる: to grow taller\n- {売|う}り{上|あ}げが{伸|の}びる: sales increase\n- {能力|のうりょく}が{伸|の}びる: ability improves\n- {麺|めん}が{伸|の}びる: noodles get soggy\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {伸|の}びる: physical stretching/growth\n- {延|の}びる: time extension (会議が{延|の}びる = meeting runs long)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {伸|の}び: growth, stretch (noun)\n- {伸|の}び{伸|の}び: freely, at ease",
